      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-284423",
      ":question/problem": "Jacob is playing a different video game where players earn points by collecting gems and trophies. Each gem is worth $g$ points, and each trophy is worth $t$ points.\n\nIn his first round, Jacob scored $560$ points by collecting $16$ gems and $8$ trophies.\nIn his second round, he scored $710$ points by collecting $20$ gems and $9$ trophies.\n\nWhich system of equations can be used to correctly determine the values of $g$ and $t$?"
